{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17391","headline":"与沈十九拾遗同游栖霞寺上方於亮上人院会宿二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"与沈十九拾遗同游栖霞寺上方於亮上人院会宿二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摄山标胜绝，暇日谐想瞩。\n萦纡松路深，缭绕云岩曲。\n重楼回树杪，古像凿山腹。\n人远水木清，地深兰桂馥。\n层台耸金碧，绝顶摩净绿。\n下界诚可悲，南朝纷在目。\n焚香入古殿，待月出深竹。\n稍觉天籁清，自伤人世促。\n宗雷此相遇，偃放从所欲。\n清论松枝低，闲吟茗花熟。\n一生如土梗，万虑相桎梏。\n永愿事潜师，穷年此栖宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}